Damn. I've loved Bob and his writings ever since I read Accidental Empires as a kid. He went through some crazy shit over the last few years (lost his house, almost blind). And when he started blogging again this year (
https://www.cringely.com/2026/05/27/where-the-heck-have-i-be...
), the stories got even worse (lost his son, heart attack, stroke). RIP.
